    "title": "Senior Software Engineer - 1mg Capital India - Immediate Joiners Preferred",
    "description": "Join the 1mg Capital India family as a Senior Software Engineer in Chandigarh. We believe in empowering our employees with the tools, training, and environment they need to succeed.\n\nAbout 1mg Capital India:\n1mg Capital India is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Design, develop and maintain scalable software applications\n• Mentor junior developers and conduct knowledge-sharing sessions\n• Write clean, maintainable, and well-documented code\n• Participate in on-call rotation for production support\n• Implement new features based on product requirements\n• Troubleshoot, debug, and resolve software defects and performance issues\n• Integrate third-party APIs and services\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Diploma or Degree in Hospitality Management\n• 10-15 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Git\n• Proficiency in React\n• Proficiency in Node.js\n• Proficiency in Rust\n• Proficiency in Machine Learning\n• Proficiency in JavaScript\n• Proficiency in Docker\n• Proficiency in Agile/Scrum\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Salary Range: 20 LPA - 40 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Chandigarh, Punjab, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with 1mg Capital India!",
